Version 2.3.0 brings one major feature: A graphic UI!

Features:
- nanoVG based graphicUI, with resizable UI surface.
  - As a result, some parameter names have been changed:
    Osc Common:
      Xmod -> Mod 2>1
      Osc2FilterMod ->Mod 2>Filter
      Sync Level -> Sync 2>1
      Waveform Reset -> Wave Mode
  - The manual has been updated accordingly and also now includes a section
    on the GUI.

Bugfixes:
- E Piano S and E Piano S Chorus were mistakingly assigned to the User
  bank, which doesn't exist by default, causing them to appear strangely
  in the preset list in Jalv (and likely other hosts as well).

As usual, a companion version 2.3.0z has been tagged on the Zynthian branch,
which supports the graphic envelope and filter display features in the Zynthian
UI.
